'''Cofagrigus''' (Japanese: '''デスカーン''' ''Desukarn'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

